  "summary": "Mattermost doesn't validate channel ownership of an existing subscription before applying edits",
  "details": "Mattermost versions 11.7.x \u003c= 11.7.0, 11.6.x \u003c= 11.6.2, 11.5.x \u003c= 11.5.5, 10.11.x \u003c= 10.11.17 Fail to validate channel ownership of an existing subscription before applying edits which allows an authenticated attacker to hijack subscriptions from channels they have no access to via a crafted PUT request to the subscription edit endpoint.. Mattermost Advisory ID: MMSA-2026-00650",
